        "markdown": "# Affiliation\n\nA temporal connection between a person or organization and an organization, optionally in a particular role.\n\n## Required fields\n\n- `title`\n- `affiliationType`\n- `subjectRef`\n- `organizationRef`\n\n## Modeling boundary\n\nKeep provenance in connected Claim → Evidence → Source nodes rather than embedded source arrays.",
